WEBVTT

00:00:00.349 --> 00:00:05.232
Export an app for other tools.

00:00:05.232 --> 00:00:13.390
Open the Developer Console and sign in with your console token.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:19.554
Open an app and go to the Export tab.

00:00:19.554 --> 00:00:22.738
Download the OpenAPI spec for this app.

00:00:22.738 --> 00:00:27.714
Or download an MCP server so AI tools can call your routes.

00:00:27.714 --> 00:00:35.660
What the spec contains: your paths and methods.
